quot;leaf&quot;},&quot;7. 新增在线解绑功能，在未连接机器狗的情况下，支持使用 app 解绑，解绑后机器狗有网络时重启即可同步解绑状态。&quot;]]],[&quot;p&quot;,{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;mr370sw825700bguzbp&quot;},[&quot;span&quot;,{&quot;data-type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;},[&quot;span&quot;,{&quot;data-type&quot;:&quot;leaf&quot;},&quot;8. 点足开放空翻动作，使用时务必注意安全，附近预留至少 1.5 米以上安全距离。&quot;]]]]\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-cangjie-fragment=\"\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-doc-key=\"4EZlweZZbPNYGqxA\">\n<p style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span data-type=\"text\">注：该固件版本需搭配 1.2.1 版本 App 使用。</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span data-type=\"text\">1. 新增 UWB 信标配对功能，更新后需先先开启信标，并且 app 进入【我的】-【跟随信标】进行信标绑定操作后即可正常使用。</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span data-type=\"text\">2. 新增 UWB 信标语音对话功能，长按信标主按键，在灯光变为黄色后，即可无需唤醒进行语音对话。</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span data-type=\"text\">3. 新增 UWB 信标快捷启动自主跟随功能，在机器狗站立状态下，双击两下信标主按键，即可自动开启自主跟随，双击两下即可退出。</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span data-type=\"text\">4. 牵引模式优化，新增牵引模式中，前方遇到障碍物自动减速。</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span data-type=\"text\">5. 优化停障功能，引入动态调整避障检测距离，提升停障效果。</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span data-type=\"text\">6. 自主跟随模式下，机器狗不会自动后退，提升安全性。</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span data-type=\"text\">7. 新增在线解绑功能，在未连接机器狗的情况下，支持使用 app 解绑，解绑后机器狗有网络时重启即可同步解绑状态。</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span data-type=\"text\">8. 点足开放空翻动作，使用时务必注意安全，附近预留至少 1.5 米以上安全距离。</span></p>\n</article>","firmwareEnDesc":"<article class=\"4ever-article\" data-clipboard-cangjie=\"[&quot;root&quot;,{},[&quot;p&quot;,{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;mr372z08u8zg6gs5wi&quot;},[&quot;span&quot;,{&quot;data-type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;},[&quot;span&quot;,{&quot;data-type&quot;:&quot;leaf&quot;},&quot;Note: This firmware version must be used together with app version 1.2.1&quot;]]],[&quot;p&quot;,{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;mr372z0a0h7hjfjyf57&quot;},[&quot;span&quot;,{&quot;data-type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;},[&quot;span&quot;,{&quot;data-type&quot;:&quot;leaf&quot;},&quot;1. Added UWB beacon pairing. After the update, please power on the beacon first, then go to &quot;],[&quot;span&quot;,{&quot;bold&quot;:true,&quot;data-type&quot;:&quot;leaf&quot;},&quot;User &gt; Follow Beacon&quot;],[&quot;span&quot;,{&quot;data-type&quot;:&quot;leaf&quot;},&quot; in the app to bind the beacon before use.&quot;]]],[&quot;p&quot;,{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;mr372z0b3k7483qtp8f&quot;},[&quot;span&quot;,{&quot;data-type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;},[&quot;span&quot;,{&quot;data-type&quot;:&quot;leaf&quot;},&quot;2. Added UWB beacon voice interaction. Press and hold the main button on the beacon. When the indicator light turns yellow, you can start voice interaction without using the wake word.&quot;]]],[&quot;p&quot;,{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;mr372z0bbt5femwwg5&quot;},[&quot;span&quot;,{&quot;data-type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;},[&quot;span&quot;,{&quot;data-type&quot;:&quot;leaf&quot;},&quot;3. Added a shortcut for starting autonomous follow via the UWB beacon. When the robot dog is standing, double-press the main button on the beacon to start autonomous follow, and double-press again to exit.&quot;]]],[&quot;p&quot;,{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;mr372z0bktaxqf5dk2p&quot;},[&quot;span&quot;,{&quot;data-type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;},[&quot;span&quot;,{&quot;data-type&quot;:&quot;leaf&quot;},&quot;4. Optimized traction mode. The robot dog will now automatically slow down when an obstacle is detected ahead during traction mode.&quot;]]],[&quot;p&quot;,{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;mr372z0cy97rb6vmhs&quot;},[&quot;span&quot;,{&quot;data-type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;},[&quot;span&quot;,{&quot;data-type&quot;:&quot;leaf&quot;},&quot;5. Optimized the obstacle-stop function by dynamically adjusting the obstacle detection distance, improving obstacle-stop performance.&quot;]]],[&quot;p&quot;,{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;mr372z0ctj72or8fjll&quot;},[&quot;span&quot;,{&quot;data-type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;},[&quot;span&quot;,{&quot;data-type&quot;:&quot;leaf&quot;},&quot;6. In autonomous follow mode, the robot dog will no longer automatically move backward, improving overall safety.&quot;]]],[&quot;p&quot;,{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;mr372z0cxcq0x7glki&quot;},[&quot;span&quot;,{&quot;data-type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;},[&quot;span&quot;,{&quot;data-type&quot;:&quot;leaf&quot;},&quot;7. Added online unbinding. When the robot dog is not connected, users can unbind it through the app. After unbinding, the robot dog will sync the unbinding status after it reconnects to the network and restarts.&quot;]]],[&quot;p&quot;,{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;mr372z0d1wszqkwwckui&quot;},[&quot;span&quot;,{&quot;data-type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;},[&quot;span&quot;,{&quot;data-type&quot;:&quot;leaf&quot;},&quot;8. Added backflip support for the point-foot version. Please pay attention to safety when using this feature and keep at least 1.5 meters of clear space around the robot dog.&quot;]]]]\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-cangjie-fragment=\"\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-doc-key=\"4EZlweZZbPNYGqxA\">\n<p style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span data-type=\"text\">Note: This firmware version must be used together with app version 1.2.1</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span data-type=\"text\">1. Added UWB beacon pairing. After the update, please power on the beacon first, then go to </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" data-type=\"text\">User &gt; Follow Beacon</span><span data-type=\"text\"> in the app to bind the beacon before use.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span data-type=\"text\">2. Added UWB beacon voice interaction. Press and hold the main button on the beacon. When the indicator light turns yellow, you can start voice interaction without using the wake word.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span data-type=\"text\">3. Added a shortcut for starting autonomous follow via the UWB beacon. When the robot dog is standing, double-press the main button on the beacon to start autonomous follow, and double-press again to exit.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span data-type=\"text\">4. Optimized traction mode. The robot dog will now automatically slow down when an obstacle is detected ahead during traction mode.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span data-type=\"text\">5. Optimized the obstacle-stop function by dynamically adjusting the obstacle detection distance, improving obstacle-stop performance.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span data-type=\"text\">6. In autonomous follow mode, the robot dog will no longer automatically move backward, improving overall safety.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span data-type=\"text\">7. Added online unbinding. When the robot dog is not connected, users can unbind it through the app. After unbinding, the robot dog will sync the unbinding status after it reconnects to the network and restarts.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span data-type=\"text\">8. Added flip support for the point-foot version. Please pay attention to safety when using this feature and keep at least 1.5 meters of clear space around the robot dog.</span></p>\n</article>","uuid":"681A9F65-66A3-4D37-9363-E25029EF775E","version":""}

